 5. Create repositories and basic services

 Phase 2: GraphQL API (6-8 hours)

 6. Define GraphQL schema
 7. Implement query resolvers
 8. Implement mutation resolvers
 9. Set up WebSocket subscriptions
 10. Add authentication to GraphQL context

 Phase 3: Build System Integration (8-10 hours)

 11. Implement BuildService (trigger builds)
 12. ESP32 build integration (idf.py wrapper)
 13. Pi5 build integration (Buildroot wrapper)
 14. Android build integration (Gradle wrapper)
 15. Build log streaming (real-time)
 16. Binary storage and serving

 Phase 4: Frontend (10-12 hours)

