 18. Set up Apollo Client + GraphQL
 19. Implement authentication flow
 20. Build Dashboard page
 21. Build Management page
 22. Real-time Log Viewer
 23. Flash Job Queue
 24. Device Management

 Phase 5: Flash Agent (12-15 hours)

 25. Create Rust project structure
 26. Implement GraphQL client
 27. JWT authentication flow
 28. Device registration
 29. Polling mechanism
 30. Binary download and caching
 31. ESP32 flashing (esptool.py)
 32. Pi5 SD flashing (dd command)
 33. Android flashing (adb)
 34. Status reporting
 35. Cross-platform builds (Mac/Windows/Linux)

 Phase 6: Coder Template (4-6 hours)

 36. Create Dockerfile with all toolchains
 37. Write coder.yaml configuration
 38. Startup scripts (PostgreSQL, backend, frontend)
 39. Environment variable configuration
 40. Documentation and setup guides

 Phase 7: Testing & Polish (6-8 hours)

 41. End-to-end testing
 42. Cross-platform agent testing
 43. Error handling and edge cases
 44. Documentation
 45. Demo video/guide

 Total Estimated Effort: 54-69 hours

